  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Combatting Child Labor in the Democratic Republic of the Congo&apos;s Cobalt Industry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cobalt project works to address child labor in the Democratic Republic of the Congo&apos;s (DRC) cobalt supply chain, with a focus on artisanal and small-scale mining. It supports key stakeholders to develop and implement strategies to reduce child labor and improve working conditions in artisanal and small-scale mines as well as in the broader cobalt supply chain.</narrative>
  </description>
